        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Melissa George, Tom Wilkinson, Jai Courtney, Angel Parrish\n- Works: Felony, Home and Away\n- Topics: acting career, nationality, rollerskating, modeling\n\nFacts:\n- Melissa Suzanne George was born on 6 August 1976 and is an Australian-American actress.\n- From 1993 to 1996, Melissa George played Angel Parrish on the Australian soap opera Home and Away.\n- Before or during the start of her acting career, Melissa George was a national rollerskating champion and a model in Australia.\n- Tom Wilkinson, Jai Courtney, and Melissa George also appeared in the film Felony.",
